{
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "Numbers and age",
  "presentation": "card",
  "content": {
    "instructions": "For numbers from 21 to 99 that are not exact tens, say the units first, then und, then the tens, written as one word: 21 = einundzwanzig (the hyphens in ein-und-zwanzig are only a pronunciation aid). Note eins → ein- (einundzwanzig), sechs → sech-, sieben → sieb- in 16, 17, 60 and 70 (sechzehn, siebzehn, sechzig, siebzig), and dreißig (with ß). Say your age with Ich bin … Jahre alt, or just Ich bin ….",
    "text": [
      "<table><caption>The tens</caption><thead><tr><th>Number</th><th>Listen</th><th>German</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>20</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-020-zwanzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: zwanzig\"></span></td><td>zwanzig</td></tr><tr><th>30</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-030-dreissig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: dreißig\"></span></td><td>dreißig</td></tr><tr><th>40</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-040-vierzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: vierzig\"></span></td><td>vierzig</td></tr><tr><th>50</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-050-fuenfzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: fünfzig\"></span></td><td>fünfzig</td></tr><tr><th>60</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-060-sechzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: sechzig\"></span></td><td>sechzig</td></tr><tr><th>70</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-070-siebzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: siebzig\"></span></td><td>siebzig</td></tr><tr><th>80</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-080-achtzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: achtzig\"></span></td><td>achtzig</td></tr><tr><th>90</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-090-neunzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: neunzig\"></span></td><td>neunzig</td></tr><tr><th>100</th><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zehner-100-hundert.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: hundert\"></span></td><td>hundert</td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "<table><caption>Numbers from 21</caption><thead><tr><th>Number</th><th>German</th><th>Listen</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><th>21</th><td>einundzwanzig</td><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zahl-021-einundzwanzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: einundzwanzig\"></span></td></tr><tr><th>34</th><td>vierunddreißig</td><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zahl-034-vierunddreissig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: vierunddreißig\"></span></td></tr><tr><th>56</th><td>sechsundfünfzig</td><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zahl-056-sechsundfuenfzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: sechsundfünfzig\"></span></td></tr><tr><th>87</th><td>siebenundachtzig</td><td><span data-audio=\"audio/lo-01-erster-kontakt/u1_g-zahl-087-siebenundachtzig.mp3\" data-audio-label=\"Play: siebenundachtzig\"></span></td></tr></tbody></table>",
      "Wie alt bist du? – Ich bin vierundzwanzig (Jahre alt)."
    ]
  }
}
